  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When GItHub runs Integration Tests, they can seemingly fail randomly. It appears that a small number of tests are exhibiting this behaviour and it may be that the issue may be due to bootstrapping not having fully completed before the test is run. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Affected ITs:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testConcurrentUpdatesToBinary",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "WARN 15:50:25.298 (ContainmentIndexImpl) Unable to commit containment index transaction 50bd3218-a314-4b67-b9e6-074815365ecf: PreparedStatementCallback; bad SQL grammar [DELETE FROM containment WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM containment_transactions t WHERE t.transaction_id = ? AND t.operation = 'purge' AND t.fedora_id = containment.fedora_id AND t.parent = containment.parent)]; nested exception is org.h2.jdbc.JdbcSQLSyntaxErrorException: Table \"CONTAINMENT\" not found; SQL statement: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "LDPContainerIT.indirectContainerModifyProxyOnDemandVersioning:701->assertMementoHasMembers:1921->assertHasMembers:1934 expected:<1> but was:<0>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testConcurrentUpdatesToBinary:4254 Only one PUT request should have been successful! expected:<1> but was:<2>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java.lang.AssertionError: expected:<204> but was:<403>\n\tat org.fcrepo.integration.auth.webac.WebACRecipesIT.testDeleteTombstone(WebACRecipesIT.java:2529)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraVersioningIT.testDeletedResourceMementosAreInaccessible:1496 expected:<410> but was:<200>\n",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "FedoraVersioningIT.testResponseForMultipleMementosInASecond:235->verifyTimemapResponse:800 expected: <2> but was: <3>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
