  "description": "<p>When GItHub runs Integration Tests, they can seemingly fail randomly. It appears that a small number of tests are exhibiting this behaviour and it may be that the issue may be due to bootstrapping not having fully completed before the test is run. </p>\n\n<p>Affected ITs:</p>\n\n\n<p>FedoraLdpIT.testConcurrentUpdatesToBinary</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>WARN 15:50:25.298 (ContainmentIndexImpl) Unable to commit containment index transaction 50bd3218-a314-4b67-b9e6-074815365ecf: PreparedStatementCallback; bad SQL grammar [DELETE FROM containment WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM containment_transactions t WHERE t.transaction_id = ? AND t.operation = 'purge' AND t.fedora_id = containment.fedora_id AND t.parent = containment.parent)]; nested exception is org.h2.jdbc.JdbcSQLSyntaxErrorException: Table \"CONTAINMENT\" not found; SQL statement: </pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>LDPContainerIT.indirectContainerModifyProxyOnDemandVersioning:701-&gt;assertMementoHasMembers:1921-&gt;assertHasMembers:1934 expected:&lt;1&gt; but was:&lt;0&gt;</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>FedoraLdpIT.testConcurrentUpdatesToBinary:4254 Only one PUT request should have been successful! expected:&lt;1&gt; but was:&lt;2&gt;</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>java.lang.AssertionError: expected:&lt;204&gt; but was:&lt;403&gt;\n\tat org.fcrepo.integration.auth.webac.WebACRecipesIT.testDeleteTombstone(WebACRecipesIT.java:2529)</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>FedoraVersioningIT.testDeletedResourceMementosAreInaccessible:1496 expected:&lt;410&gt; but was:&lt;200&gt;\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p><tt>FedoraVersioningIT.testResponseForMultipleMementosInASecond:235-&gt;verifyTimemapResponse:800 expected: &lt;2&gt; but was: &lt;3&gt;</tt></p>",
